{"strongs": "H5030", "word": "נָבִיא", "translit": "na.vi", "root": "נביא", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "spokesman, speaker, prophet", "definition": "נָבִיא 306 noun masculine spokesman, speaker, prophet — ׳ נ Gen 20:7 + 155 t.; suffix נְבִיאֶ֑ךָ Exod 7:1 plural נְבִיאִים Num 11:29 + 82 t.; נְנִאִים Jer 27:18 + 16 t.; suffix נְבִיאַי Ps 105:15 נְבִיָאו 1Kgs 22:22 נְבִיאָו֯ 2Kgs 17:13 , etc.; — 1. genuine prophet of ׳ י , נביא , anciently called רֹאֶה , 1Sam 9:9 (antiquarian note); change probably occurred in times of Elijah and is first reflected in Ehpraimitic source literally as applied to Abraham Gen 20:7 Moses Deut 34:10 , M. and other early prophets. Hos 6:5 ; Hos 12:11 (twice in verse); Hos 12:14 (twice in verse); Amos 2:11 ; Amos 2:12 of prophets in ecstatic state Num 12:6 ( E ), Num 11:24 ( J E ). So in Judaic literature, of prophet like Moses Deut 18:15 ; Deut 18:18 ( D ), of Aaron (as mouthpiece of Moses) Exod 7:1 ( P ), of Samuel 1Sam 3:20 , an unknown Judg 6:8 in time of Samuel prophets were organized in bands: חֶבֶל נביאים ׳ להקת הנ 1Sam 19:20 and in time of Elijah were בְּנֵי הַנְּבִיאִים = members of prophets' guilds 1Kgs 20:35 ; 2Kgs 2:3 ; 2Kgs 2:5 ; 2Kgs 2:7 ; 2Kgs 2:15 ; 2Kgs 4:1 ; 2Kgs 4:38 (twice in verse); נָבִיא of genuine prophets (besides phrases), in Judaic prophets, only Jeremiah, Jer 1:5 Ezekiel, Ezek 2:5 = Ezek 33:33 of ancient prophets Jer 28:8 ; Jer 28:9 (3 t. in verse); Zech 1:6 ; Zech 8:9 especially הנביאים הראשׁנים Zech 1:4 ; Zech 7:7 ; Zech 7:12 , compare הנביאים עבדי(וׅ my ( his ) servants the prophets 2Kgs 9:7 ; 2Kgs 17:13 ; 2Kgs 17:23 ; 2Kgs 21:10 ; 2Kgs 24:2 (all R D ) Ezra 9:11 ; Jer 7:25 ; Jer 25:4 ; Jer 26:5 ; Jer 29:19 ; Jer 35:15 ; Jer 44:4 ; Amos 3:7 ; Zech 1:6 , compare Ezek 38:17 ; Dan 9:6 ׳ עבדוֺ הַנּ his servant the prophet 1Kgs 14:18 ; 2Kgs 14:25 הַנָּבִיא with proper name: Jerome , 2Chr 36:12 ; Dan 9:2 + 31 t. Jeremiah (but ᵐ5 only 4 t., the rest probably redactional, see Gie Jer. xxvii ); Elijah 1Kgs 18:36 (om ᵐ5 ), 2Chr 21:12 ; Mal 3:23 Nathan 2Sam 7:2 + 10 t. Samuel and Kings; 4 t. Chronicles; Ps 51:2 (title); Isaiah, 2Kgs 19:2 ; 2Kgs 20:1 ; 2Kgs 20:14 = Isa 37:2 ; Isa 38:1 ; Isa 39:1 ; 2Kgs 20:11 ; 2Chr 26:22 ; 2Chr 32:20 ; 2Chr 32:32 Habakkuk Hab 1:1 ; Hab 3:1 (titles); Haggai, Hag 1:1 ; Hag 1:3 ; Hag 1:12 ; Hag 2:1 ; Hag 2:10 Zechariah, Zech 1:1 ; Zech 1:7 (titles); elsewhere several others in Samuel, Kings and Chronicles 15 t.; נביא is used elsewhere of genuine prophecy only 1Sam 9:9 + 34 t. Samuel and Kings; 1Chr 16:22 = Ps 105:15 , + 13 t. Chronicles; Ps 74:9 complains of absence of ׳ נ ; לַחְתֹּם חָזוֺן וְנָבִיא Dan 9:24 see חתם 2. false prophets: prophets as official class, beside priests, character as false prophets: Isa 28:7 ; Jer 2:26 ; Jer 4:9 ; Jer 6:13 ; Jer 8:1 ; Jer 8:10 ; Jer 13:13 ; Jer 14:18 ; Jer 18:18 ; Jer 23:11 ; Jer 23:33 ; Jer 23:34 ; Jer 26:7 ; Jer 26:8 ; Jer 26:11 ; Jer 26:16 ; Jer 32:32 ; Zech 7:3 , app. also 2Kgs 23:2 ; Neh 9:32 ; Lam 2:20 ; Jer 29:1 ; Ezek 7:26 (in these not characterized); always false (except of ancient and special prophets given above) in Amos 7:14 ; Hos 4:5 ; Hos 9:7 ; Hos 9:8 ; Mic 3:5 ; Mic 3:6 ; Mic 3:11 ; Isa 3:2 ; Isa 9:14 ; Isa 29:10 ; Isa 5:13 ; Isa 5:31 ; Isa 14:13 ; Isa 14:14 ; Isa 14:15 (twice in verse); Jer 23:9 + 16 t. Jer 27:9 ; Jer 27:14 ; Jer 27:15 ; Jer 27:16 ; Jer 27:18 ; Jer 29:8 ; Jer 29:15 ; Jer 37:19 ; Ezek 13:2 (twice in verse); Ezek 13:3 ; Ezek 13:4 ; Ezek 13:9 ; Ezek 13:16 ; Ezek 14:4 ; Ezek 14:7 ; Ezek 14:9 (twice in verse); Ezek 14:10 ; Ezek 22:25 ; Ezek 22:28 ; Zeph 3:4 ; Lam 2:9 ; Lam 2:14 ; Lam 4:13 especially discredited Deut 13:2 ; Deut 13:4 ; Deut 13:6 ; Deut 18:20 (twice in verse); Deut 18:22 (twice in verse); Zech 13:2 ; Zech 13:4 ; Zech 13:5 such a prophet Hananiah called הַנָּבִיא Jer 28:1 ; Jer 28:5 ; Jer 28:10 ; Jer 28:12 ; Jer 28:15 ; Jer 28:17 ( ᵐ5 omits in all but v Jer 28:1 , where ψευδοπροφήτης ). Usage of prophets themselves gives such a bad flavour to נביא , that we are not surprised that it is absent from exilic Isaiah, the Wisdom Literature, and Psalms (except for special reasons in 3 Psalms given under 1 ). 3. heathen prophets 1Kgs 18:20 ; 1Kgs 19:1 ; 2Kgs 3:13 (twice in verse); נביאי האשׁדה 1Kgs 18:19 נביאי הבעל 1Kgs 18:19 ; 1Kgs 18:22 ; 1Kgs 18:25 ; 1Kgs 18:40 ; 2Kgs 10:19 ; 1Kgs 22:6 ; 1Kgs 22:10 ; 1Kgs 22:12 ; 1Kgs 22:13 ; 1Kgs 22:22 ; 1Kgs 22:23 = 2Chr 18:5 ; 2Chr 18:9 ; 2Chr 18:11 ; 2Chr 18:12 ; 2Chr 18:21 ; 2Chr 18:22 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4928')\">BDB4928</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5030')\">H5030</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4927')\">BDB4927</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4929')\">BDB4929</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>נָבִיא</bdbheb><sub>306</sub> <b>noun masculine</b> <highlightword>spokesman, speaker, prophet</highlightword> — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 20:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,20,7)\">Gen 20:7</ref> + 155 t.; suffix <bdbheb>נְבִיאֶ֑ךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 7:1\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(2,7,1)\">Exod 7:1</ref> plural <bdbheb>נְבִיאִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 11:29\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,29)\">Num 11:29</ref> + 82 t.; <bdbheb>נְנִאִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 27:18\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(24,27,18)\">Jer 27:18</ref> + 16 t.; suffix <bdbheb>נְבִיאַי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 105:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"105\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"105\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,105,15)\">Ps 105:15</ref> <bdbheb>נְבִיָאו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:22\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,22)\">1Kgs 22:22</ref> <bdbheb>נְבִיאָו֯</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,13)\">2Kgs 17:13</ref>, etc.; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> genuine <highlight>prophet</highlight> of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>נביא</bdbheb>, anciently called <bdbheb>רֹאֶה</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"1Sam 9:9\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(9,9,9)\">1Sam 9:9</ref> (antiquarian note); change probably occurred in times of Elijah and is first reflected in Ehpraimitic source literally as applied to Abraham <ref ref=\"Gen 20:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,20,7)\">Gen 20:7</ref> Moses <ref ref=\"Deut 34:10\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(5,34,10)\">Deut 34:10</ref>, M. and other early prophets. <ref ref=\"Hos 6:5\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(28,6,5)\">Hos 6:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 12:11\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(28,12,11)\">Hos 12:11</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Hos 12:14\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(28,12,14)\">Hos 12:14</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Amos 2:11\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(30,2,11)\">Amos 2:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 2:12\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(30,2,12)\">Amos 2:12</ref> of prophets in ecstatic state <ref ref=\"Num 12:6\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(4,12,6)\">Num 12:6</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Num 11:24\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,24)\">Num 11:24</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>). So in Judaic literature, of prophet like Moses <ref ref=\"Deut 18:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,18,15)\">Deut 18:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 18:18\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(5,18,18)\">Deut 18:18</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup>), of Aaron (as mouthpiece of Moses) <ref ref=\"Exod 7:1\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(2,7,1)\">Exod 7:1</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), of Samuel <ref ref=\"1Sam 3:20\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(9,3,20)\">1Sam 3:20</ref>, an unknown <ref ref=\"Judg 6:8\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,8)\">Judg 6:8</ref> in time of Samuel prophets were organized in bands: <bdbheb>חֶבֶל נביאים</bdbheb> <wrongReferenceRemoved/> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>להקת הנ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 19:20\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(9,19,20)\">1Sam 19:20</ref> and in time of Elijah were <bdbheb>בְּנֵי הַנְּבִיאִים</bdbheb> = members of prophets' guilds <ref ref=\"1Kgs 20:35\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(11,20,35)\">1Kgs 20:35</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 2:3\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(12,2,3)\">2Kgs 2:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 2:5\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(12,2,5)\">2Kgs 2:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 2:7\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(12,2,7)\">2Kgs 2:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 2:15\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(12,2,15)\">2Kgs 2:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 4:1\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(12,4,1)\">2Kgs 4:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 4:38\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(12,4,38)\">2Kgs 4:38</ref> (twice in verse); <bdbheb>נָבִיא</bdbheb> of genuine prophets (besides phrases), in Judaic prophets, only Jeremiah, <ref ref=\"Jer 1:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,1,5)\">Jer 1:5</ref> Ezekiel, <ref ref=\"Ezek 2:5\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(26,2,5)\">Ezek 2:5</ref> = <ref ref=\"Ezek 33:33\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(26,33,33)\">Ezek 33:33</ref> of ancient prophets <ref ref=\"Jer 28:8\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(24,28,8)\">Jer 28:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 28:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,28,9)\">Jer 28:9</ref> (3 t. in verse); <ref ref=\"Zech 1:6\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(38,1,6)\">Zech 1:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 8:9\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(38,8,9)\">Zech 8:9</ref> especially <bdbheb>הנביאים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>הראשׁנים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zech 1:4\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(38,1,4)\">Zech 1:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 7:7\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(38,7,7)\">Zech 7:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 7:12\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(38,7,12)\">Zech 7:12</ref>, compare <bdbheb>הנביאים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>עבדי(וׅ</bdbheb> <highlight>my</highlight> (<highlight>his</highlight>) <highlight>servants the prophets</highlight> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 9:7\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(12,9,7)\">2Kgs 9:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,13)\">2Kgs 17:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:23\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,23)\">2Kgs 17:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 21:10\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(12,21,10)\">2Kgs 21:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 24:2\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(12,24,2)\">2Kgs 24:2</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('R')\"><reflink>R</reflink><sup><reflink>D</reflink></sup></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Ezra 9:11\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(15,9,11)\">Ezra 9:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 7:25\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(24,7,25)\">Jer 7:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 25:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,25,4)\">Jer 25:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 26:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,26,5)\">Jer 26:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 29:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,29,19)\">Jer 29:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 35:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,35,15)\">Jer 35:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 44:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,44,4)\">Jer 44:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 3:7\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(30,3,7)\">Amos 3:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 1:6\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(38,1,6)\">Zech 1:6</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Ezek 38:17\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(26,38,17)\">Ezek 38:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 9:6\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(27,9,6)\">Dan 9:6</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עבדוֺ הַנּ</bdbheb> <highlight>his servant the prophet</highlight> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 14:18\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(11,14,18)\">1Kgs 14:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 14:25\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(12,14,25)\">2Kgs 14:25</ref> <bdbheb>הַנָּבִיא</bdbheb> with proper name: <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb(